      "cr": 0,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Ratie.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, generated from the article's own words. no XP ledger entry; archetype default → CR 0 as a civilian. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>Speaker River Follower — bricks</strong> — Liberated Toads — Speaker River Follower</p><p>Status: Listed — Liberated Toads roster #41, not yet seen in the field</p><p>Ratie is roster entry #41 of the Liberated Toads: Speaker River Follower (Tier 6 — Armed Group). The roster lists Bricks for a weapon; cap colour brick; listed, not yet seen in the field. That is the whole record, and Waluigi files the whole record: a face on the roster beats a rumour in a barrel. WAH.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Club</strong> — “Speaker River Follower — bricks”</li><li><strong>As Filed</strong> — “Speaker River Follower — bricks”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/toad_ratie</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/toad_ratie</code>.</p>",
